    "density": {
      "$comment": "How much of the surface survives at each floor. max_rows null means all of them. The module reads its floor from --tier, exactly as venue.js does; it never measures a width. Pad and desk both get the card unit: the relay asked for prominent visual cards, and a pad has the room for them.",
